LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Has +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_RagingSerpent_AimBonus> aim and +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_RagingSerpent_CritBonus> crit.<br><Bullet> Deals <Ability:M31_PA_WS_RagingSerpent_Damage> points of damage.<br><Bullet> Can be used while disoriented: <Ability:M31_PA_WS_RagingSerpent_bAllowWhileDisoriented><br><Bullet> Can be used while burning: <Ability:M31_PA_WS_RagingSerpent_bAllowWhileBurning>.<br><br><font color='#909497'>\"I can't seem to control all this rage that's inside me!\"</font>"
