LocHelpText="Increases sight range by <Ability:M31_PA_WS_Vigilance_SightRangeBonus> meters (~<Ability:M31_PA_WS_Vigilance_SightRangeBonus_Tiles> tiles). Bolt attacks can be delayed until the enemy action."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> The delayed attack is not considered reaction fire and therefore it can crit and is not affected by reaction fire penalties or perks related to reaction fire.<br><Bullet> The delayed attack activates when the enemy moves or takes a hostile action.<br><br><font color='#909497'>\"I can see you.\"</font>"

